{
  "name": "missed_sessions",
  "description": "IOS-011 per-plan planned and missed sessions (I4, MP-07, ADR-052, ADR-054). Slots are planned workouts with ISO weekday (1 = Monday). An occurrence exists on day D when D is inside an activation of the plan and the program has not finished on D. A reschedule moves an occurrence; the latest entry for the same (plannedWorkoutId, originalDate) wins and the old date no longer counts. A session completes an occurrence when it belongs to the same plan and is linked to the same planned workout on that date, or else to another planned workout of the plan on that date; one session completes one occurrence. Sessions of other plans and unlinked sessions (including unlinked backfills) never count. Occurrences are evaluated from the first activation through today and listed by date, then plannedWorkoutId. W1 = ...101 (Mon), W3 = ...103 (Wed), W5 = ...105 (Fri). 2026-11-02 and 2026-11-09 are Mondays.",
